# EarPlug backend environment. Copy to `.env.local` and fill in.
#
# CLIENT configuration does NOT live here — it lives in `config/dev.json` and
# `config/prod.json`, which web, iOS and Android all read via
# `--dart-define-from-file`.
#
# ── The one rule ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A Convex deployment and a Clerk instance are chosen TOGETHER, never
# independently. Which deployment pairs with which Clerk instance, and what
# goes wrong when they don't, is documented in ONE place:
#
#     docs/environments.md
#
# Read that before changing anything below.

# ── Convex CLI ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Written by `npx convex dev`. Selects which deployment CLI commands target.
# Prod is never selected here — reach it explicitly with `--prod`.
CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=dev:brilliant-cardinal-773
CONVEX_URL=https://brilliant-cardinal-773.convex.cloud
CONVEX_SITE_URL=https://brilliant-cardinal-773.convex.site

# ── Convex deployment env ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `CLERK_JWT_ISSUER_DOMAIN` is set per deployment with `npx convex env set` and
# is NOT read from this file. See docs/environments.md.

# ── Clerk backend tooling only; no client code reads this ───────────────────
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
